Answers to your two questions:

1) Two more Pyeongtaek shipments are on the water: deliveries 80456802 and 80=
456811, arriving in Rotterdam on 23 and 24 October. They were invoiced with t=
he old template, so they would have the same problem. I will hold the declara=
tions until the plant sends corrected invoices with the statement. Please mak=
e sure the corrected PDFs reach me by 21 October.

2) A refund is possible. A repayment request can be filed within 3 years of t=
he debt notification, but I want to file as soon as we have the corrected inv=
oices, so that the money is not tied up for long. I will need the corrected i=
nvoices for INV-48211, INV-48212 and INV-48219 for the file.

